! Synthetic research case; parameters are illustrative, not a construction design.
Clear
Set DefaultBaseFrequency=50
New Circuit.feeder basekv=10.0 pu=1 phases=3 bus1=source.1.2.3 frequency=50 mvasc3=1000 mvasc1=500
Redirect LineCodes.dss
Redirect Lines.dss
Redirect Loads.dss
Redirect Generation.dss
Set VoltageBases=[10.0]
CalcVoltageBases
BusCoords BusCoords.csv
Set mode=snapshot controlmode=off maxiterations=100 tolerance=1e-8
Solve
